rt of the lineup. Passage 1 says 'Secretly Greatly' replaced 'Real Men'. If 'Real Men' was the show in that slot, then 'Real Men' is the answer. But 'Real Men' is mentioned in Passage 4 and 6 as being *along with* 'Animals' and 'King of Mask Singer'. Actually, 'Real Men' (Jinjjja Saram) was a long-running segment of Sunday Night. In early 2015, 'Sunday Night' consisted of 'Dad! Where Are We Going?' and 'Real Men'. Then 'Dad!' was replaced by 'Animals' (Passage 4). So in Jan-March 2015, the slots were 'Animals' and 'Real Men'. In April 2015, 'Animals' was replaced by 'King of Mask Singer' (Passage 6), so the slots were 'King of Mask Singer' and 'Real Men'. 

